   262	def _role_ref_fact_types(value: Any, out: set[str]) -> None:
   263	    """Every string ``fact_type`` value reachable in ``value``.
   264	
   265	    Covers a ``role_ref`` (``{fact_type, role}``), a role sequence and a
   266	    guarded rule's atoms (``{fact_type, bind}``) with one family-agnostic walk;
   267	    an id that names no fact type is harmless, since the caller intersects
   268	    with the populated set.
